{"type":"text","timestamp":1790389314217,"sessionID":"ses_f24805792ffeNOUpNt8wFIKexF","part":{"id":"prt_0db84e2990017hY8iJPISECFR7","messageID":"msg_0db84763900129VlKBEnzowECa","sessionID":"ses_f24805792ffeNOUpNt8wFIKexF","type":"text","text":"The shared character will own health, hit reception, hurt state, and knockback; player and enemy scenes only need collision-layer and animation configuration. The boss sheet has valid idle frames `[0]`, walk frames `[10..17]`, hurt frames `[60..62]`, and punch frames `[20..23]`, so I’ll preserve every valid frame in each used row and add punch for enemy attacks.","time":{"start":1790389314201,"end":1790389314202},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_05fcdaccba9390c0016ab72c411ebc87d2a1be88d4bfae9877","phase":"commentary"}}}}
