ent character damage, hurt reaction, knockback, and removal behavior","status":"in_progress","priority":"high"},{"content":"Configure player DamageReceiver and hurt animation","status":"pending","priority":"high"},{"content":"Create reusable basic enemy script and scene with spritesheet animations","status":"pending","priority":"high"},{"content":"Add exactly two player-linked enemies to world scene","status":"pending","priority":"high"},{"content":"Run Godot checks and visual smoke test","status":"pending","priority":"high"}],"truncated":false},"title":"5 todos","time":{"start":1790389314207,"end":1790389314208}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_05fcdaccba9390c0016ab72c4167e887d2905a663552280321"}},"id":"prt_0db84e29b001aY3sLjU4LNw1LI","sessionID":"ses_f24805792ffeNOUpNt8wFIKexF","messageID":"msg_0db84763900129VlKBEnzowECa"}}
